    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "text_2",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 480,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "STAGE 3: FIT ASSESSMENT + SOLUTION PROPOSAL\n\nPM assesses: can MAIA solve their problem?\n- Strong fit \u2192 propose solution\n- Partial fit \u2192 propose what's possible\n- Poor fit \u2192 park or disqualify\n\nDiscuss with Tech Lead, CTO, CEO\nDecision gates: Proceed / Park / Reject",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "containerId": "stage_2",
      "originalText": "STAGE 3: FIT ASSESSMENT + SOLUTION PROPOSAL\n\nPM assesses: can MAIA solve their problem?\n- Strong fit \u2192 propose solution\n- Partial fit \u2192 propose what's possible\n- Poor fit \u2192 park or disqualify\n\nDiscuss with Tech Lead, CTO, CEO\nDecision gates: Proceed / Park / Reject"
    },
