      "x": 400,
      "y": 960,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "STAGE 6: FEATURE SPEC (MAIA CODEX)\n\nPM writes detailed feature spec in MAIA CODEX:\n- prd.md \u2014 product requirements document\n- design.md \u2014 design and architecture\n- tasks.md \u2014 work breakdown\n- user stories + acceptance criteria\n\nPush to GitHub\nDev team checks MAIA CODEX for latest updates",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "containerId": "stage_5",
      "originalText": "STAGE 6: FEATURE SPEC (MAIA CODEX)\n\nPM writes detailed feature spec in MAIA CODEX:\n- prd.md \u2014 product requirements document\n- design.md \u2014 design and architecture\n- tasks.md \u2014 work breakdown\n- user stories + acceptance criteria\n\nPush to GitHub\nDev team checks MAIA CODEX for latest updates"
    },
