      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "STAGE 8: PM MANUAL TEST\n\nNo QA team \u2014 PM tests manually\nTest based on client business scenarios\nDoes feature work as specified?\n\nBug found \u2192 inform dev \u2192 dev fixes \u2192 PM re-tests\nRepeat until no issues",
      "textAlign": "center",
