      "text": "STAGE 9: UAT WITH CLIENT\n\nPM runs UAT with client\nTest case by test case\nAll test cases pass \u2192 client sign off\n\nBug found \u2192 inform dev \u2192 fix \u2192 re-UAT\nClient sign off \u2192 LAUNCH",
